     *
     * Notes:
     *   Assumes the XI matricies have already been updated for the given q
     *   tau = Y . pi with pi_i = [m, m*c(3), I_O(6)=[Ixx,Ixy,Ixz,Iyy,Iyz,Izz]] per link
